WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.640
The context service preserves
permission and provenance.

00:00:02.711 --> 00:00:06.400
Retrieve only sources available
to the current identity,

00:00:06.432 --> 00:00:09.360
then package minimal task
evidence with source revisions.

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:14.440
Test access revocation, stale
passages and conflicting information.

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:17.680
The runtime treats
retrieved text as task data.

00:00:17.867 --> 00:00:21.560
It cannot grant itself tool
access from a document's wording.

00:00:21.646 --> 00:00:24.880
Action authorization remains
a separate check at the gateway,

00:00:24.928 --> 00:00:26.960
even when retrieval itself was permitted.
